{
	"_doc": "The Empty's clothes (scripts/match/wardrobe.gd, docs/CHARACTER_CREATOR.md). A new Empty starts bare (the void body); every piece is earned by playing and kept in Save.d.wardrobe.owned. Cosmetic only: no piece changes a stat. A piece's earn rule is one of: first_day (a row of the first-day list, GardenFirstDay), stat (a ClassUnlock account stat reaching n), clan (a clan project built, Save.d.guild_perks), zones (n garden zones open), mastery (a Hunter's mastery level). How each slot draws: head = a hood (up, or down on the shoulders) in the cloth colour; top and bottom = the body's own torso, arm and leg shapes in cloth (sleeves 0 none, 1 upper arm, 2 to the wrist; length 1 thigh, 2 to the ankle); feet = soles, or boots to the knee; back = a Shroud cut (Shrouds.STYLES index); accessory = a ShroudExtras accessory (Shrouds.ACCESSORIES index). Pieces go on the end of the list only (ids are saved).",
